{
  "id": "1SA.24",
  "number": "24",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Sam 24",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "24",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "24",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi uSawuli esebuyile ekuxotsheni amaFilistiya, wabikelwa kwathiwa: UDavida usenkangala yaseEngedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USawuli wasethatha abantu abayizinkulungwane ezintathu abakhethiweyo kuye wonke uIsrayeli, wayadinga uDavida labantu bakhe ngasempumalanga kwamaDwala amagogo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wafika ezibayeni zezimvu ezazisendleleni. Kwakukhona lapho ubhalu; uSawuli wangena kulo ukuba aye ngaphandle. UDavida labantu bakhe babehlezi ngaphakathi kobhalu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bakaDavida bathi kuye: Lufikile usuku iNkosi eyatsho ngalo kuwe isithi: Ngizanikela isitha sakho esandleni sakho, uzakwenza kuso lokho okubona kufanele. UDavida wasenyenya, wasika ensitha umphetho wengubo kaSawuli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngemva kwalokho uDavida wazisola ngoba wayesike umphetho wengubo kaSawuli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathi ebantwini bakhe: INkosi uNkulunkulu kayingivimbele ukuba ngingenzi okubi enkosini yami, ogcotshiweyo weNkosi uNkulunkulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wabehlula ngalawomazwi abantu bakhe, kabavumelanga ukuba bamhlasele uSawuli. USawuli waphuma obhalwini, wahamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngemva kwalokho uDavida laye wasuka waphuma obhalwini; wammemeza uSawuli wathi: Nkosi yami! Lapho uSawuli enyemukula, uDavida wathi mbo ngobuso phansi, wakhuleka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wasesithi kuSawuli: Ulalelelani amazwi abantu abathi: UDavida ufuna ukukulimaza? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lamuhla uzibonele ukuthi iNkosi ibikunikele esandleni sami obhalwini; abanye bebesithi kangikubulale, kodwa mina ngakuhawukela. Ngathi: Kangiyikuphakamisela isandla sami kuyo inkosi yami, ngoba ingogcotshiweyo weNkosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khangela, baba, nanku umphetho wengubo yakho usesandleni sami; ngiwusikile, kodwa kangikubulalanga. Ngalokhoke zibonele ukuba kakukho ububi lesiphambeko kimi. Kangikonanga ngalutho, loba wena ungizingela ukuba ungibulale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi uNkulunkulu kayahlulele phakathi kwethu; kodwa lanxa ingaphindisela kuwe ngenxa yami, kangiyikuphakamisela isandla sami phezu kwakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Njengesaga sasendulo esithi: Kwababi kuvela okubi; kodwa mina kangiyikuphakamisela isandla sami phezu kwakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yakoIsrayeli ilandelana lobani na? Uxotshana lobani na? Uxotshana lenja efileyo, indwebundwebu nje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi uNkulunkulu kayibe ngumahluleli, yahlulele phakathi kwethu, ihlole icala lami, ingikhulumele, ingikhulule esandleni sakho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi uDavida eseqedile ukukhuluma lawomazwi kuSawuli, uSawuli wathi: Yilizwi lakho lelo, mntanami, Davida na? USawuli wadazuluka, wakhala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesithi kuDavida: Ulungile kulami, ngoba wena ungiphindisele ngokuhle, kodwa mina ngikuphindisele ngokubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Utshengisile lamuhla ukuthi ungenzela okuhle, ngoba kawungibulalanga lapho iNkosi ibinginikele ezandleni zakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nxa umuntu efica isitha sakhe, uyasiyekela sihambe na? Ngalokhoke iNkosi ikunike umvuzo omuhle ngokwenzileyo kimi lamuhla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manjeke ngiyazi ukuba uzakuba yinkosi impela, lokuba umbuso wakoIsrayeli uzaqiniswa esandleni sakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke funga kimi ngeNkosi ukuba kawuyikuyiqeda inzalo yami emva kwami, lokuba kawuyikulicima ibizo lami endlini kababa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wasefunga kuSawuli. USawuli wabuyela ekhaya; kodwa uDavida labantu bakhe baya enqabeni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
